use wrap from "std:list"
variable items is list of "a", "b", "c", "d"
variable idx is 1
constant delta is -3
change idx to the result of wrap idx + delta in length of items
say item idx of items
change idx to the result of wrap idx + 6 in length of items
say item idx of items
change idx to the result of wrap idx + 0 in length of items
say item idx of items
